## Close comment templates

**Obsolete v2:**
> Closing — this targets the deprecated v2 [block]. Stackable V3 uses `stackable/[block]`. If this still occurs on V3, please open a new issue with repro steps.

**Not on roadmap:**
> Closing — not on our [current roadmap](https://wpstackable.com/roadmap). Feel free to reopen with a detailed use case.

**Implemented:**
> Closing as implemented. [Feature/setting] is available in V3. See [link if helpful].

**Duplicate:**
> Closing as duplicate of #XXXX.

